{"words": [{"text": "قَالُوا۟", "translation": "They said"}, {"text": "سُبْحَـٰنَكَ", "translation": "Glory be to You"}, {"text": "لَا", "translation": "No"}, {"text": "عِلْمَ", "translation": "knowledge"}, {"text": "لَنَآ", "translation": "(is) for us"}, {"text": "إِلَّا", "translation": "except"}, {"text": "مَا", "translation": "what"}, {"text": "عَلَّمْتَنَآ ۖ", "translation": "You have taught us"}, {"text": "إِنَّكَ", "translation": "Indeed You"}, {"text": "أَنتَ", "translation": "You"}, {"text": "ٱلْعَلِيمُ", "translation": "(are) the All-Knowing"}, {"text": "ٱلْحَكِيمُ", "translation": "the All-Wise"}], "sahih": "They said, \"Exalted are You; we have no knowledge except what You have taught us. Indeed, it is You who is the Knowing,1 the Wise.\"2"}